sequenceDiagram
  participant ALB as ALB / client
  participant API as API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant OBJ as Object storage
  participant Q as Valkey queue/limits
  ALB->>API: GET /health/live
  API-->>ALB: 200 process ok
  ALB->>API: GET /health/ready
  API->>DB: SELECT 1
  API->>OBJ: health check
  API->>Q: ping
  alt every dependency available
    API-->>ALB: 200 ready
  else dependency unavailable or raises
    API-->>ALB: 503 not_ready (sanitized)
  end
  Note over API,Q: Protected operations fail closed if shared limiter is unavailable

